# sriq ABox split (slice 9j): an individual with only a declaration, in an inconsistent TBox
# (⊤ ⊑ A, A ⊑ ⊥). The individual folds to nothing; the hierarchy run finds ⊤ → ⊥.
# Expect: inconsistent.
@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:A a owl:Class .
owl:Thing rdfs:subClassOf :A . :A rdfs:subClassOf owl:Nothing .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual .
